  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take a cut across one eyelid, also injuring the eye beneath, causing excruciating pain.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Blinded] (2), which cannot be removed until you have had Medical Attention. Also, you must pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test or drop what you have in your primary hand to clap it to the injury. If unsuccessful, you may attempt another <strong>Average (+0) Endurance</strong> Test at the beginning of each of your next turns to remove the hand and use it normally again.</p>"
